# Feature architecture

## Folder layout (per feature)

```
features/<feature>/
  components/
    <Feature>Page.tsx      # compose sections only
    <Feature>HeroSection.tsx
    <section>/             # optional subfolders (pricing/, explore-api/)
  constants/               # hero, footer, section defaults
  data/                    # *-section.data.ts (static content)
  types/                   # *-section.types.ts, *Props types
  index.tsx                # export page component
  utils/                   # only when logic is non-trivial
```

## Page wiring

- `app/<route>/page.tsx` imports from `@/features/<feature>` (thin).
- `features/<feature>/index.tsx` exports `{ default as XComponent } from "./components/XPage"`.
- No `components/index.tsx` monolith pages.

## Data and types

- Types live in `types/`, not exported from `data/` files.
- Data files: `*-section.data.ts` (kebab-case).
- Constants: `*-page.constants.ts`, `*-section.constants.ts` (defaults, labels, counts).

## Refactor constraints

- Do **not** change existing Tailwind classes or user-facing copy/button labels.
- Split components; move copy to `data/` or `constants/` without rewriting UI.

## Verify

Run `npm run build` after structural feature changes.
